abstract = {This paper presents a Turbo Pascal program, which optimizes an operating radial primary distribution power network. The program suggests changes of conductor sizes so as to have an acceptable voltage profile across the entire network with the minimum cost. By using pointers and tree data structures the computation procedure is dynamic and the problem solution fast and complete.}
